msgctxt "Addon Summary"
msgid "Wolfenstein 3D (ECWolf)"
msgstr "Wolfenstein 3D (ECWolf)"

msgctxt "Addon Description"
msgid ""
"ECWolf is an advanced source port for Wolfenstein 3D, Spear of Destiny, and "
"Super 3D Noah's Ark based off of the Wolf4SDL code base."
msgstr "ECWolf är en avancerad källkodsport för Wolfenstein 3D, Spear of Destiny och Super 3D Noah's Ark baserad på Wolf4SDL-kodbasen."

